 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 40-3§9 Differences from earlier prose: 9.1: the grindstone result repair_cost is 2^n - 1 for n remaining curses, not 2n + 1 (n = 0 to 5)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "MN3-GRIND-REMOVE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "MN3-GRIND-REMOVE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
